ants\nInternational definition Any of the following and no signs of proliferative retinopathy:\n\u2022 More than 20 intraretinal hemorrhages in each of 4 quadrants\n\u2022 Definite venous beading in 2 or more quadrants\n\u2022 Prominent IRMA in 1 or more quadrants\nPDR One or both of the following:\n\u2022 Neovascularization\n\u2022 Vitreous/preretinal hemorrhage\nIRMA = intraretinal microvascular abnormalities; NPDR = nonproliferative DR; PDR = proliferative DR.\nNOTES:",
